WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:13.080
If visiting the shop simply isn't possible, whether you live abroad, live far away, or have health issues, there's an alternative using photos.

2
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:24.408
Send the artist current front and side photos (bare face recommended) in advance, then go through an in-depth consultation by phone or message.

3
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:36.192
This lets the artist assess hair length, thickness, skin tone, and problem areas beforehand, so any hairpiece or product needed on the day can be prepared in advance,

4
00:00:36.528 --> 00:00:43.296
and you can be shown similar past cases to get a sense of how you'll look.

5
00:00:43.632 --> 00:00:47.184
Even without an in-person trial run,

6
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:58.776
simply knowing the artist already understands your concerns and is prepared eases much of the day-of anxiety, so you can focus on the wedding.
